.TH DOTFILES 1 "2026-07-15" "dotfiles" "Dotfiles Manual"
.SH NAME
dotfiles \- manage the dotfiles shell framework
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dotfiles
.RI [ command ] " " [ args ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage a stow-based, ZDOTDIR shell framework: toggle modules, (re)create
symlinks, byte-compile for speed, run health checks, lint, test and benchmark.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
list modules and their on/off state
.TP
.B enable <name>...
re-enable module(s) (persists)
.TP
.B disable <name>...
disable module(s) (persists)
.TP
.B reload
recompile, then re-exec the current shell
.TP
.B update
git pull --ff-only, then re-run install.sh
.TP
.B update-tools [--all | TOOL...]
update tools from manifest or re-install specific tools
.TP
.B jira <cmd> [args]
Jira YAML create/update/sync/test
.TP
.B gitlab <cmd> [args]
GitLab list / invite
.TP
.B secrets <cmd>
keyring: set|list|clear|export
.TP
.B bugwarrior <cmd>
task sync: render|pull|uda
.TP
.B invite [args]
local invite policy (local/tools/invite_policy.py)
.TP
.B compile
byte-compile the zsh framework (.zwc) for faster startup
.TP
.B stow [--if-needed]
(re)create the dotfiles symlinks via stow
.TP
.B work-stow [--if-needed]
stow ~/Work links (from local/profile/mount.lst)
.TP
.B doctor
health checks (paths, symlinks, core tools, var/)
.TP
.B doctor-tools
detailed tool health check (binaries, versions, hooks)
.TP
.B validate
validate configuration integrity (syntax, symlinks, profiles)
.TP
.B check
lint scripts (shellcheck .sh + zsh -n/zshellcheck .zsh + actionlint + editorconfig)
.TP
.B check-aliases
detect conflicting or redefined aliases
.TP
.B audit
scan the working tree for secrets (betterleaks)
.TP
.B test
run the bats smoke tests in test/
.TP
.B bench [N]
benchmark interactive zsh startup (N runs, default 10)
.TP
.B profile [--sort]
detailed startup profiling by module with timing
.TP
.B sync <host:path>
rsync repo from a remote machine (includes dotfiles; see: dotfiles help sync)
.TP
.B doc [man]
regenerate the man page from this help
.TP
.B help
show this help
.SH FILES
.TP
.B $DOTFILES_DIR/config/zsh
ZDOTDIR: zsh startup files.
.TP
.B $DOTFILES_DIR/var
Generated, gitignored tools/plugins/cache.
.TP
.B $DOTFILES_LOCAL/profile
Per-user shell drop-ins (local.sh aliases.sh company.sh mount.lst). Gitignored.
API tokens: OS keyring via "dotfiles secrets" (not shell profile files).
.TP
.B $DOTFILES_LOCAL/disabled
Persisted module toggles (dotfiles disable).
.TP
.B $DOTFILES_DIR/var/work
Generated stow package for ~/Work links (not in config/stow/ — machine-specific).
.SH SEE ALSO
stow(8), zsh(1), starship(1), sheldon(1)
